I think it's so, so important.

00:51:39.260 --> 00:51:41.910
So definitely, definitely
appreciate the way you both

00:51:42.790 --> 00:51:45.230
contributed and I'll be
following the ongoing work

00:51:45.230 --> 00:51:46.380
that you all are doing.

00:51:47.298 --> 00:51:51.100
- Lecrae you're the
bridge that gives me hope.

00:51:51.100 --> 00:51:52.090
